{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>Burn.</b> A burn by fire, as its meaning." "Some say that פצע is to draw blood, and חבורה is a wound without blood. And the Gaon [Saadia] said that פצע is breaking of a bone, and חבורה is a wound of blood."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:02.907286019Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}